''✦Jianxin✦''

''Jianxin, a Taoist monk and successor of Fengyiquan, has dedicated her life to mastering the ultimate martial art. With the power to harness and transform environmental Chi, she can create protective barriers that purify both body and mind.''

== Appearance ==
Jianxin appears to be a young woman of average height and build. She has teal eyes with blue pupils and long, knee-length black hair with white streaks that is braided into twin tails along with a very long tuft of hair growing out the top of her head. Her tacet mark is located along her left clavicle.

===Clothing===
Jianxin wears a black dress with a Ying Yang pattern that resembles a mix between a qipao and a hanfu with a slit that reveals her left clavicle and various wind like yellow and teal markings going throughout along with wearing green and black wind patterned mini shorts and green and black asymmetrical thigh high wind patterned boots with some bandages underneath and Ying Yang-styled earrings.

